<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Rita Zanella Benson said she raised her fiscal 1996 earnings estimate to $3.88 per share from $3.84 per share.</p>
<p>--He made the move &quot;as a result of ... strong results and bright outlook for Q496.&quot;</p>
<p>--Shares in the publishing concern were off 1/8 to 82-3/4.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
